        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari 26.2 partially supports <code class=\"notranslate\">scrollend</code> event but still marked as Tech Preview only</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Test here:<br>\n<a href=\"https://codepen.io/web-dot-dev/pen/OJdxKqJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codepen.io/web-dot-dev/pen/OJdxKqJ</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or run these:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">'onscrollend' in HTMLElement.prototype<br>\n&lt; true<br>\n'onscrollend' in Document.prototype<br>\n&lt; true<br>\n'onscrollend' in VisualViewport.prototype<br>\n&lt; false</p>\n</blockquote>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526265277-3e056cb5-d06d-44e1-aca5-b3368fcb2da2.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..1vaXHvlCx1QbCBa5TsKBwlCoote9NtXZQHJe3Ven8vk\"><img width=\"528\" height=\"215\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526265277-3e056cb5-d06d-44e1-aca5-b3368fcb2da2.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..1vaXHvlCx1QbCBa5TsKBwlCoote9NtXZQHJe3Ven8vk\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 215px;\"></a>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also noted here: <a href=\"https://webkit.org/blog/17640/webkit-features-for-safari-26-2/#:~:text=Safari%2026.2%20adds%20support%20for%20the%20scrollend%20event\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/blog/17640/webkit-features-for-safari-26-2/#:~:text=Safari%2026.2%20adds%20support%20for%20the%20scrollend%20event</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28664",
            "title": "Safari 26.2 partially supports scrollend event",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-14T21:00:36.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-14T07:57:42.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "tunetheweb",
                "url": "https://github.com/tunetheweb"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Webkit has implemented an initial version of Speculation Rules (prefetch only) behind a flag. This only includes some of Speculation Rules the features (notable no prerender but also a couple of other features).</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208490-0a8c7231-e278-4c67-ac7f-cfd8e180d2cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..59bgjeL0dZIf-xOPCSo6karsFVNHgx6oivubNUEWu2w\"><img width=\"838\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208490-0a8c7231-e278-4c67-ac7f-cfd8e180d2cb.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..59bgjeL0dZIf-xOPCSo6karsFVNHgx6oivubNUEWu2w\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 269px;\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">When you turn this on you (and restart Safari) you can visit <a href=\"https://chrome.dev/prerender-demos/prefetch.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chrome.dev/prerender-demos/prefetch.html</a> and see the pages are prefetched:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208926-f09ae810-18ac-4097-bd4c-83d0447010fc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..sezEdeTL8KfZ8dCh5tBM1hZf4tAnB_eqCWqTI6kgv2A\"><img width=\"1213\" height=\"382\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/526208926-f09ae810-18ac-4097-bd4c-83d0447010fc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..sezEdeTL8KfZ8dCh5tBM1hZf4tAnB_eqCWqTI6kgv2A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 382px;\"></a>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Implementation bug: <a href=\"https://webkit.org/b/295193\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/b/295193</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Implemented in these PRs by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/yoavweiss/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/yoavweiss\">@yoavweiss</a> :<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3Ayoavweiss+is%3Aclosed+SpeculationRules\">https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3Ayoavweiss+is%3Aclosed+SpeculationRules</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
