        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 147 adds support for the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/counter-increment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">counter-*</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/quotes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">quotes</code></a> properties on the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Selectors/::marker\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">::marker</code></a> pseudo-element. See <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2000404\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2000404</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a separate data point for <code class=\"notranslate\">counter-*</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes</code>, as I thought some browsers may conceivably add support separately, and they feel like different concerns.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have created a test case at <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Chris-Mills/pen/yyOGdGJ?editors=1100\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codepen.io/Chris-Mills/pen/yyOGdGJ?editors=1100</a>. In testing, I found that the features:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Work in Firefox 147, but not 146</li>\n<li>Don't work in Chrome Canary or Safari technology preview.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28625",
            "title": "Firefox 147 supports `counter-*` and `quotes` properties on `::marker`",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-10T12:00:21.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-09T16:43:55.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/782446?u=b04ff20ddafb41870583859554c1e7c3180adca3&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Added implementation URLs for Bun, Chrome and Node.js support.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28614",
            "title": "Add Temporal bugs for Bun + Node.js",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-09T17:30:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-08T14:11:03.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "simon04",
